comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T20:38:39.675Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for the exact snapshot validation text and Sentry classifier lineage found completed prior classifier refreshes pm-flbo/pm-lg9i/pm-io4t/pm-yohx but no item for this distinct snapshot identifier validation shape. Live Sentry evidence is privacy-scrubbed: one handled CommandError in release pm-cli@2026.7.29, first/last seen 2026-07-29, count 1."
  "2026-07-29T20:42:26.704Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the escaped-defect regression failed before implementation with sentry.high=3 instead of 2, then passed after introducing a separate exact validation allowlist. Live production-shape inspection showed metadata.type=Error and no unhandled marker; the contract now ignores that exact handled validation for Error/CommandError/PmCliError while explicit unhandled events and unrelated handled Error events remain blocking. Live gate passes with critical=0, high=0, ignored_expected_handled=1."
  "2026-07-29T20:48:58.157Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: 395 test files and 6,533 tests passed with literal all-source V8 coverage at statements 45,911/45,911, branches 32,805/32,805, functions 9,373/9,373, lines 44,587/44,587. Typecheck passed across core, typetests, packages, and examples. ESLint passed with zero warnings; jscpd found zero clones across 817 analyzed files; static quality/docstring gate passed at mandatory 100%; package SDK parity, token budget, gate registry, public SDK surface, entrypoint cost, and CLI transport gates passed. pnpm audit found no known vulnerabilities. pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1 check reported CHANGELOG.md unchanged. pm health and history drift are clean; validation retains only the known historical 292-item resolution warning baseline."
  "2026-07-29T20:49:39.682Z","harness:codex","Package lifecycle evidence: package-owned changelog verification refreshed the managed-extension receipt for the already-current pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1; generation check remained unchanged."
  "2026-07-29T20:50:29.792Z","harness:codex","PR evidence: follow-up observability closeout opened as https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/816 from commit cb758a935 after all local gates passed."
  "2026-07-29T20:55:00.554Z","harness:codex","CI correction: Gates (static) correctly detected that CHANGELOG.md became stale because pm-k785lu was closed after the pre-close changelog check. Regenerated CHANGELOG.md only through pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1, then linked the generated document; no generator defect was found."
  "2026-07-29T20:57:14.703Z","harness:codex","Static-gate rerun evidence: package-generated CHANGELOG.md is current after closing pm-k785lu; version, contracts, SDK surface, secrets, ESLint, duplication, 100% static/docstring quality, package boundary, SDK parity, token budget, gate registry, performance budgets, and npm pack dry-run all pass locally."
